  "body_markdown": "![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/290371783_404757335026019_7389677311620195486_n.jpg)\n\n## Sirop\n\n- Flori de soc\n- Merișoare\n- Muguri de pin\n- Muguri de brad\n- Căpșuni\n- Afine\n- Păpădie\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/290693309_404757185026034_2141954567436609205_n.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/290865569_404757175026035_4963279516490421032_n.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/293238307_415182807316805_5322301138824822589_n.jpg)\n\n## Dulceață și gem\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/290730652_404757375026015_4403434660874421731_n.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/290816971_404757245026028_1787527048849441684_n.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/293479134_415182953983457_8605863945668013349_n-1.jpg)\n\n- Cireșe\n- Merișoare\n- Fructe de soc\n- Măceșe\n- Afine\n- Căpșuni\n- Caise\n- Ardei iute\n- Mere, struguri și scorțișoară\n\n## Produsele pot fi achiziționate de la magazinul de suveniruri – Peștera Grota Ursului din Moneasa\n\n### Program:\n\n- Vineri : orele 15:00 – 18:30\n- Sâmbătă: orele 11:00 – 18:30\n- Duminică: orele 11:00 – 18:30\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/293238307_415182807316805_5322301138824822589_n-1.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/293479134_415182953983457_8605863945668013349_n-1-1.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/293817345_419350330233386_3104176846421690932_n.jpg)\n\n## Comenzi:\n\n> [Contact](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/contact/)\n\nPentru comenzi mai mari de 100 lei se asigură livrări gratuite în municipiul Arad!\n\nLike Loading...\n\n### Related\n\nPosted by[transilvaniacavediving](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/author/transilvaniacavediving/)[July 30, 2022 July 30, 2022](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/2022/07/30/sirop-si-dulceata-straita-bunicii/)Posted in[Uncategorized](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/category/uncategorized/)",
